      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A barb’s ire and covert curse can be used on neutral-aligned (on the good/evil axis), rather than just good-aligned, allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Assignment:</strong> The barb must attempt to guide neutral creatures towards good alignments in the same way they attempt to test the faith of good characters.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/barb#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
